 student model designed to learn from the teacher BERT model.\n', 'Name:NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING (NLP)\nDescription:The field of computer science concerned with enabling computers to understand and process human language.\n', 'Name:XLNET\nDescription:A pre-trained language model that has achieved success in many NLP tasks. ; A pre-trained language model built with Transformer layers.\n', 'Name:ROBERTA\nDescription:A pre-trained language model that has achieved success in many NLP tasks. ; A pre-trained language model built with Transformer layers.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=157, avg_entity_tokens=37, max_entities=148, num_groups=2, entities_per_group=[148, 9]
